  "content": "<h2>湯姆的簡易儲存模組</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/master/banner.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><h3>這是模組的 Forge/NeoForge 版本，如果你在尋找 Fabric 版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往專案連結</a></h3><p>簡單的原版風格儲存模組。<br>功能：</p><ul>\n<li>儲存與合成終端機</li>\n<li>物品欄連接器</li>\n<li>開放式板條箱</li>\n<li>無線終端機</li>\n<li>過濾連接器</li>\n<li>物品欄漏斗</li>\n</ul><p>如果安裝了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-contraption-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 機械裝置終端機</a>，終端機也可以在 Create 機械裝置上運作。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/911/265/2024-07-08_01.png\" alt=\"火車上的終端機\"></p><p>模組介紹影片：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UoIi5q8kyo8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RwRKNhZ7uec?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nW5ElcWiC3c?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h3>各 Minecraft 版本與載入器對應的下載：</h3><p>1.21.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.21.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.21.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.21.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.6 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.18.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.17.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.16.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.15.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.15.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/tom5454\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aEaIJ8A.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>",
